<title>USA: Inacom Corp buys HW Electronics assets.</title>
<headline>Inacom Corp buys HW Electronics assets.</headline>
<dateline>OMAHA, Neb. 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Inacom Corp said Wednesday it paid an undisclosed price to acquire certain assets of  HW Electronics, a provider of information technology services in Van Nuys, California.</p>
<p>The company said the deal will expand its coverage in the Southern California market. The business will operate under the Inacom Information Systems name, Inacom said.</p>
<p>Inacom is a technology management services provider.</p>
<p>Its shares closed down 1/4 Wednesday at 27.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
